# 3️⃣ MOST IMPORTANT LINKED LIST PATTERN 🔥

# 👉 Fast & Slow Pointers

Two pointers move at different speeds:

```text
Slow → moves 1 step
Fast → moves 2 steps
```

Used for:

✅ Detecting cycles
✅ Finding middle node
✅ Finding cycle-related properties

---

# 4️⃣ FIND THE MIDDLE OF A LINKED LIST ⭐⭐⭐

Example:

```text
1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5
```

### Approach

```text
slow = head
fast = head
```

Move:

```text
slow → 1 step
fast → 2 steps
```

When `fast` reaches the end:

```text
slow = middle
```

### Python Code

```python
def middleNode(head):
    slow = fast = head

    while fast and fast.next:
        slow = slow.next
        fast = fast.next.next

    return slow
```

### Complexity

| Time | Space |
| ---- | ----- |
| O(n) | O(1)  |

