# 7️⃣ STACK — LIFO 📚

Stack follows:

> **Last In, First Out**

Example:

```text
Push 1
Push 2
Push 3
```

Stack:

```text
TOP → 3
       2
       1
```

Removing:

```text
Pop → 3
```

